   "body": "#568 is done (#577, b314f82). The last Opus re-check (https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/577#issuecomment-6709610023) found three older points that the PR did not cause. They are kept here for the consistency pass:\n- Classic style: the header date measures about 4.27:1 with a blue accent (hue around 240°).\n- Classic style, light: the date on a whitelisted author's header measures 4.45:1.\n- The GAP Counts table on dev-swift is out of date (162 rows listed, 164 actual), and needs a docs fix.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
